==Existence Elsewhere==
===Kumanchu Royale===
Angelic Sleipnir is a variant of '''Sleipnir''' (スレイプニール ''Sureipunīru''), a weaker [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy from [[Kumanchu Royale]] that lacked his Angelic counterpart's horn, wings and halo. He had a slower attack rate, being Kumanchu Royale's equivalent of [[Le'boin]]. His [[Enemy Guide]] entry was almost the same as Angelic Sleipnir's current Japanese description, except he was referred to as just a horse (馬) instead of a Pegasus (天馬), and instead of "the image you would associate with his name" (名前から連想するイメージ), it said, "the image everyone thinks of" (みんなが思っているイメージ).
