==Trivia==
*This enemy is based on the eight-legged horse [[wikipedia:Sleipnir|Sleipnir]] from Norse mythology.
**[[Infernal Pegasus Deonil]] may represent fellow Norse horse [[wikipedia:Skinfaxi and Hrímfaxi|Skinfaxi]] ("shiny mane"), who pulls the chariot of [[wikipedia:Dagr|Dagr]] (the personification of day) across the sky every morning and illuminates both the sky and Earth with his mane, similar to how Deonil sets both the skies and the ground alight.
*His attack power of 2,247 is an "angel number" encouraging you to build your confidence and self-esteem; the first three digits of his 363,000 health are an especially lucky "angel number" meaning you are on the right path and should continue to pursue your ambitions; and his unusual range of 372 indicates that you should work together with those around you and obey the rules that have been laid beside you.

